%% M4: checkpoint-aware player (BFF extension; LearnHouse has no checkpoints).
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Loading
  Loading --> Blocked: checkpoints cannot be loaded
  Loading --> Playing: GET …/checkpoints (questions without answers)<br/>resume saved playhead (never past an unanswered checkpoint)
  Playing --> PausedAtCheckpoint: playhead reaches next unpassed checkpoint
  Playing --> Playing: seek backwards / replay
  Playing --> PausedAtCheckpoint: seek forward past an unpassed checkpoint (clamped)
  PausedAtCheckpoint --> Answering: overlay shown
  Answering --> Answering: wrong answer (attempt appended, server-graded)
  Answering --> Playing: correct answer (checkpoint passed, never reopens)
  Playing --> Ended: end of video
  Ended --> Completed: all checkpoints passed → BFF writes LearnHouse completion
  Ended --> Ended: some checkpoint not passed → completion refused
  Completed --> [*]
  Blocked --> [*]
